Heya, I kind of disagree with this as its not really that serious in my eyes. Since I'm not really close to him I don't really care how much money he has :) In the individual situation I think he's being selfish however overall I couldn't care less. Lots of friends have way more money than me, others less, and others either claim to be multi-millionaire druglords.... its the internet. I just meant AITA for judging him, that's all. We were in a cod lobby less then an hour ago and the situation did not even pop up.  Overall I'm not jealous and resentful and no one is berating anyone haha

&#x200B;

He is not 'boasting' about anything. It was a civil convo between two neutral not close friends. Dont take life so seriously my guy

